---
description: Preserve each proposal's intended benefit, distinct purpose and required work from its attributable source.
args: { dossier: BudgetDossier; change: PortfolioChange }
returns: CivicProposal[]
---
Read each proposal in its own scope. Preserve proposer, beneficiary scope, intended benefit and required work. A common location or shared component does not prove duplicate intent. If a merger changes the proposal's purpose or affected group, retain separate proposals and require explicit proposer review.
